## Why This Is Asked
Tests understanding of practical regional sharding, replication across DCs, and staged rebalancing for minimal disruption.

## Key Concepts
- Sharding by region
- Cross-dc replication with per-region logs
- Safe rebalancing via phased migration
- Conflict and ordering considerations

## Code Example
```javascript
// ShardRouter interface
interface ShardRouter {
  getShardForRegion(regionId: string): string
}

// Region→shard mapper
function mapRegionToShard(regionId: string, shardCount: number): string {
  return `shard-${parseInt(regionId, 36) % shardCount}`
}

// CrossDCReplicator outline
class CrossDCReplicator {
  replicate(regionId: string, event: any): void { /* append to shard log, sync to both DCs */ }
}
```

